From c879f90a08fa2ea4479bfc63ce9838301ccbc758 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] pinctrl: mediatek: add MT6897 GPIO, EINT and pin functions

Add the MT6897 GPIO register tables, five EINT instances and peripheral
pin functions, including the microSD slot.

Original-Commit: local development history
Original-Author: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Original-Date: 2026-10-15T18:07:15+08:00
Original-Commit: local development history
Original-Author: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
