Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
---
 drivers/pinctrl/mediatek/Kconfig              |  10 +
 drivers/pinctrl/mediatek/Makefile             |   1 +
 drivers/pinctrl/mediatek/pinctrl-mt6897.c     |  86 ++
 drivers/pinctrl/mediatek/pinctrl-mtk-mt6897.h | 743 ++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 840 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/pinctrl/mediatek/pinctrl-mt6897.c
